      ":question/problem": "Consider the augmented matrix $X,$ given by\n\n$$\nX=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}9 & -2 & -6 & -2 \\\\ -9 & -3 & 0 & 6 \\\\ 9 & 0 & -8 & 2\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nWhat matrix results from carrying out the row operation $R_{2}:=-5R_{2}$ on $X?$",
